            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>截至台北時間23日11:29，櫃買市場<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>上漲7.96點（或3.02%），暫報271.27點。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>歷史漲跌幅</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul><li>近 1 週：-23.1%</li><li>近 1 月：-31.01%</li><li>近 3 月：-32.01%</li><li>近 6 月：-37.79%</li><li>今年以來：-4.68%</li></ul></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>焦點個股</em></p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>高階PCB板概念領漲+5.99%。其中    金像電(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2368:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2368\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2368-TW</a>)            上漲        9.99%            ;        敬鵬(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2355:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2355\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2355-TW</a>)            上漲        9.95%            ;        健鼎(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3044:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3044\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3044-TW</a>)            上漲        8.82%    。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>HDI電路板概念領漲+5.94%。其中    金像電(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2368:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2368\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2368-TW</a>)            上漲        9.99%            ;        敬鵬(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2355:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-sec